  "translation": "Na em i go bek, i sendim wanpela bikman bilong ol fifti — namba tri — wantaim ol fifti man bilong en. Na bikman bilong ol fifti, namba tri, i go antap, i kam, i faldaun long ol bun bilong en long stret long Eliya, i askim marimari long em, i tokim em: Man bilong Elohim, mi askim yu, olsem laif bilong mi, na laif bilong ol wokman bilong yu dispela — fifti — i ken stap gut long ai bilong yu.",
